  "answer": "Pool ocp-poc-small-pool on lapwing has lifespan {default: 3d, maximum: 7d, unclaimed: 14d}.\n\n- A freshly claimed environment runs for the default 3 days before Babylon retires it, unless someone extends it.\n- It can be extended to at most 7 days (the pool's maximum), so claimed on 2026-11-03 09:00 UTC it is retired by 2026-11-10 09:00 UTC at the latest.\n- So it will not cover a 10-day PoC: 7 days is the ceiling, 3 days short.\n- The 14d value is the unclaimed lifespan: how long an idle, pre-provisioned handle sits in the pool before it is recycled. It does not apply to a claimed environment.\n\nThe pool uses the provider ocp-poc-small-aws and currently holds 6 resource handles (min_available 4)."
